{"id":"edcd1eb132936613","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-world.md","title":"Possible World","display":"df-world — Possible World","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-world","aliases":["89-df-world","world","可能世界","possible world"],"display":"df-world — Possible World","depends_on":[],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-world"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-world</span><span>world</span><span>可能世界</span><span>possible world</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-world — Possible World"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-world-—-Possible-World-$w$\">df-world — Possible World <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}world}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{World}_{W}\\coloneqq W,\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{World}(w;W)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in W.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}world}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{World}_{W}\\coloneqq W,\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{World}(w;W)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in W.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 是任意非空载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathrm{World}_{W}\">\\(w\\in\\mathrm{World}_{W}\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 是该载体中的世界。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>可能世界概念源自哲学中的模态分析：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>真实世界是我们所处的实际世界</li>\n<li>其他可能世界表示&quot;可能存在的&quot;状态</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在Kripke语义中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box \\varphi\">\\(\\Box \\varphi\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 中真 ⟺ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-可及世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 中真</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond \\varphi\">\\(\\Diamond \\varphi\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 中真 ⟺ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-可及世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 中真</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在可证性逻辑GL中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>世界可以理解为&quot;理论的状态&quot;</li>\n<li>可及关系表示&quot;理论的可扩展性&quot;</li>\n<li>逆良基性指每个非空世界子集存在无后继元素，不等同于载体有限；在通常选择原则下等价于无无限可及链</li>\n</ul>\n<p>可能世界的特征取决于框架性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自反框架：每个世界可及自身 ⟹ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\varphi\">\\(\\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\varphi\\)</span> 成立</li>\n<li>传递框架：可及的传递性 ⟹ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\Box \\Box \\varphi\">\\(\\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\Box \\Box \\varphi\\)</span> 成立</li>\n<li>传递且逆良基框架：同时满足两项条件 ⟹ Löb公理成立（Boolos，第 4 章 pp.74–77）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>：世界和可及关系构成的结构</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>：添加赋值后的完整语义结构</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"642c63ec0f3c8567\" href=\"?note=642c63ec0f3c8567\" title=\"89-df-accessibility\">89-df-accessibility</a>：世界之间的关系</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a>：公式在世界中的真值</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：Boolos，第 4 章 pp.68–71；世界作为非空模型载体的元素。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-world-—-Possible-World-$w$","text":"df-world — Possible World $w$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]：世界和可及关系构成的结构","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]：添加赋值后的完整语义结构","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-accessibility","status":"resolved","id":"642c63ec0f3c8567","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-accessibility]]：世界之间的关系","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]：公式在世界中的真值","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"W\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}world}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{World}_{W}\\coloneqq W,\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{World}(w;W)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in W.","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\mathrm{World}_{W}","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box \\varphi \\rightarrow \\Box \\Box \\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1845,"backlinks":[{"id":"642c63ec0f3c8567","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W\\ne\\varnothing$ (see [[89-df-world]])."},{"id":"4505fdbef0375a48","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$w \\in W$ (world, see [[89-df-world]])"},{"id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$w \\in W$ (world, see [[89-df-world]])"},{"id":"920317161a2cce71","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$w \\in W$ (world, see [[89-df-world]])"},{"id":"774a7723667e1813","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9eaa23de86feec90","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W\\ne\\varnothing$ (see [[89-df-world]])."},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-world]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-414","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-world]]"}],"outgoing":["c78d4bf1505bda5c","ab746eb779e20ce0","642c63ec0f3c8567","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}